      "description": "封面右上的「追蹤方格子」「邀請我分享」，鐵灰底上的白色外框按鈕。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cover\"><a class=\"ds-btn-outline\" href=\"#\">追蹤方格子</a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-cover{background:var(--cover,#474C55);padding:24px} .ds-btn-outline{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;padding:12px 22px;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--cover-ink,#EBECF3);border-radius:4px;color:var(--cover-ink,#EBECF3);font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.06em;transition:background-color .2s ease,color .2s ease} .ds-btn-outline:hover{background:var(--cover-ink,#EBECF3);color:var(--cover,#474C55)} .ds-btn-outline:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--marker,#F7E26B);outline-offset:3px}"
