      "description": "沿封面下緣排列的梯形主題籤；選中的站到前面，未選中的下沉、壓暗、用白字。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-tab--quality\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-tab__t\">品質管理｜APQP 第三版改版總覽</span><span class=\"ds-tab__m\">2026-10　約 2 小時</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab ds-tab--ai\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-tab__t\">AI 協作開發｜AI 當工程師，我當主管</span><span class=\"ds-tab__m\">2026-09　約 60 分鐘</span></button></div><div class=\"ds-tabs-sheet\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:28px 24px 0;background:var(--cover,#474C55)} .ds-tab{--bg:var(--topic-quality,#E2583E);--on:var(--on-quality,#16181B);position:relative;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;height:64px;margin-left:-6px;padding:10px 40px 0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--on);font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;isolation:isolate;z-index:1;transform:translateY(10px);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)} .ds-tab:first-child{margin-left:0} .ds-tab::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-6% 0 -20px;z-index:-1;background:var(--bg);border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;transform:perspective(260px) rotateX(20deg);transform-origin:50% 100%;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.28),inset 0 -7px 8px -4px rgba(0,0,0,.22);filter:brightness(.82) saturate(.9)} .ds-tab--ai{--bg:var(--topic-ai,#3A6FD8);--on:var(--on-ai,#fff)} .ds-tab[aria-selected=false]{color:#fff} .ds-tab:hover{transform:translateY(6px)} .ds-tab[aria-selected=true]{z-index:3;transform:none} .ds-tab[aria-selected=true]::before{filter:none;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.32)} .ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--marker,#F7E26B);outline-offset:-6px} .ds-tab__t{display:block;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em} .ds-tab__m{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em} .ds-tabs-sheet{position:relative;z-index:2;height:40px;background:var(--paper,#fff);box-shadow:0 -3px 9px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}"
